SymbolChecker: Bugfix to take parent message visibility into account.

The early exit in IsNamespacedEnum would trigger examples like

edition = "2024";

local message Parent {
  export enum Child {
     ZERO = 0;
  }
  reserved 1 to max;
}

to be considered not namespaced, as the default-to-local early exit would fire.

New unit tests are added for this and related cases.

